<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">LessMimic</span>: Long-Horizon Humanoid Interaction with Unified Distance Field Representations</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
