<figure id="A0.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE A1: </span><span id="A0.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training hyperparameters for each stage of the <span id="A0.T1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">LessMimic</span> pipeline.</span> All three stages—interaction skill pre-training, discriminative post-training, and policy distillation—share the same policy architecture but differ in their optimization configurations. The batch size notation <math id="A0.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M\times 8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M\times 8</annotation></semantics></math> denotes <math id="A0.T1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> samples across 8 parallel environments.</figcaption>
